  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between TBST and TST in studies including people with active TB, grouped by test pair: C-Tb5mm vs TST5mm 80.84%, C-Tb5mm vs TST15mm 76.39%, DST AI vs TST5mm 92.56%, DST5mm vs TST5mm 95.36% and C-TST vs TST 5mm 81.25%. The overall random-effects pooled agreement is 88.29% (82.14–92.51) across 2260 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين اختبارات TBST وTST في الدراسات التي شملت مصابين بالسل النشط، مصنّفة حسب زوج الاختبارات: C-Tb 5 مم مقابل TST 5 مم 80.84%، وC-Tb 5 مم مقابل TST 15 مم 76.39%، وDST AI مقابل TST 5 مم 92.56%، وDST 5 مم مقابل TST 5 مم 95.36%، وC-TST مقابل TST 5 مم 81.25%. ويبلغ التوافق المجمّع الإجمالي 88.29% (82.14–92.51) لدى 2260 مشاركاً.",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
